      "content": "idk if i can \"reach out\" to anyone. what's the point? everyone i knew is gone because they only cared about the version of me that actually mattered. now that i'm just... nothing... i'm just a burden. i feel like i'm just taking up space that someone else could actually use. it's like i'm just waiting for a life that isn't coming back.",
